      "review_level": "full_owner_prefix_plus_exact_pinned_template_and_complete_residual_review",
      "assessment": "Bout boundary wraps injected acts with start journaling, capture, panic/interruption classification, optional refusal-bundle persistence and explicit final journal residuals. Start append failure prevents acts, while missing optional journal permits an unjournaled run. Completion append failure is retained separately even if result is Ok, so consumers must not discard journal_residuals. Interruption returns captured turns but does not enter refusal-bundle persistence; repeated residual detail keys can overwrite one detail while the vector preserves all. Useful custody orchestration, not the seven-act algorithm or proof of external exactly-once execution. Prefix plus complete generated-template transfer read; no acts or ports invoked.",
