      "assessment": "All1074 lines directly read, including the full generated trailer. Dialectic kernel is explicitly separate from the live runner: seven ordered acts, unique lexical seat labels, depth<=5, exact Ratio<i64> budget debit, closed wire records and complete replay of stored budget/turn/evidence identities. Arithmetic checks refuse intermediate overflow even if a reduced mathematical result might fit; this is a conservative representation domain. Nest clones the full remaining budget without debiting the parent, so depth-bounded local accounting does not bound aggregate sibling spend. Seven valid declarations can finish PASS with zero spend and arbitrary well-formed subject hashes; sealing checks self-consistency, not underlying evidence or independent seats. Public state/receipt records can be manually constructed but restoration enforces the replay constraints. No original kernel/native run; JCS/literature dependencies remain separately pending.",
